---
/**
 * /wallpapers/entrepreneurship — SEO landing page for the Entrepreneurship
 * category. Chrome page (ChromeLayout), fully indexable, links through to
 * the real photos at /gallery#builder (world key `builder`).
 */
import ChromeLayout from '../../layouts/ChromeLayout.astro';
---

<ChromeLayout
  title="Entrepreneur & Business Motivation Wallpapers | motivationalwallpaper.com"
  description="Momentum-focused wallpapers for building a business in the quiet, unseen hours"
>
  <h1>Entrepreneur & Business Motivation Wallpapers</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Built for the stretch where no one's watching and nothing's proven yet.
  </p>

  <p>
    Building something from nothing is mostly quiet work — invoices,
    follow-ups, and small decisions with no one around to clap. These
    entrepreneurship wallpapers are built for that stretch, before the
    traction or the proof, when the only thing keeping the momentum going is
    you showing up again the next day. Dark, minimal backdrops with a
    single line of gold keep the focus on execution instead of hype: build
    it in the quiet, and let the results speak later.
  </p>
  <p>
    Whether you're bootstrapping a first product, freelancing your way to
    something bigger, or grinding through the unglamorous middle of a
    business no one else can see the potential in yet, this category is a
    daily nudge to keep moving. It's not about chasing a feeling of
    inspiration — it's a lock screen that reflects back the identity you're
    building toward: someone who executes, in silence, one ordinary day at
    a time, until the work becomes obvious to everyone else too.
  </p>

  <p class="cta">
    <a href="/gallery#builder">Browse the Entrepreneurship wallpapers &rarr;</a>
  </p>
</ChromeLayout>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: var(--t-title1-size);
    font-weight: var(--t-title1-weight);
    letter-spacing: var(--t-title1-track);
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: var(--t-lead-size);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }
  p {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .cta {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .cta a {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
